        <mxCell id="65" value="DESIGN NOTES&#xa;• DAMAGE_REPORT key = (RentalNo, ReportNo); Photos is multivalued and maps to DAMAGE_REPORT_PHOTO.&#xa;• Feedback is optional and at most one per rental; Rating is 1–5.&#xa;• ViolationNo is assumed globally unique because it is issued by the traffic department." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;fontColor=#78350f;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
