        <mxCell id="66" value="DESIGN NOTES&#xa;• CorporateInvoice and CorporateInvoiceLine are proposed to support monthly corporate billing; BA must approve fields and workflow.&#xa;• PAYMENT links to either RentalNo (direct) or InvoiceNo (corporate); exactly one must be populated.&#xa;• Card/bank transfer requires a unique transaction reference; cash has no reference." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;fontColor=#78350f;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
